c-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z
M1001 80h400000v40h-400000z"/></svg></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.305em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示与光滑域面积相等的圆的半径；如果改为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">/</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sqrt{V_k/\pi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;"></span><span class="mord sqrt"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.935em;"><span class="svg-align" style="top:-3.2em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.2em;"></span><span class="mord" style="padding-left:1em;"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.22222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">/</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">π</span></span></span><span style="top:-2.895em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.2em;"></span><span class="hide-tail" style="min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="400em" height="1.28em" viewBox="0 0 400000 1296" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin slice"><path d="M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119
c34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120
c340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067
l0 -0
c4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11
H40000v40H1012.3
s-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232
c-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1
s-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26
c-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z
M1001 80h400000v40h-400000z"/></svg></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.305em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，结果的单位就不再是长度。</p>
<p>如果所有体积分和表面积分都含有 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">π</span></span></span></span>，可以把这个公共因子一起约去。这样算出的位移、孔压和温度不变，但统计完整一圈的总力、总流量时，仍需把 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">π</span></span></span></span> 乘回来。建议直接保留 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">π</span></span></span></span>：长度用 m、应力用 kPa 时，等效节点力就是 kN。基本应变公式和半径在积分中的位置可参见 <a href="https://bleyerj.github.io/comet-fenicsx/tours/linear_problems/axisymmetric_elasticity/axisymmetric_elasticity.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FEniCSx 轴对称弹性示例</a>；下面有关 SNS 离散的讨论按本笔记中的几何与组装定义展开。</p>
<h3 id="section-6">2.3 组装：按节点编号对齐，再相加</h3>
<p>本文统一用 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Assemble</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{Assemble}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mord mathrm">Assemble</span></span></span></span></span> 表示组装。它的意思就是：<strong>把对应节点自由度的行或列，按节点编号和自由度类型对齐，再相加。</strong> 刚度矩阵需要对齐行和列；B、N、E 只需对齐节点列，它们的应变、标量或梯度分量行保持原顺序。位移的径向与轴向分量、孔压、温度分别对应各自的位置。面积仍写成 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span>。</p>
<p>例如，只看每个节点的一个标量贡献（数值仅用于示意）。三角形 1 的节点依次为 4、8、12，三角形 2 的节点依次为 4、12、19。按节点编号对应后，组装结果是：</p>
<div class="note-table-scroll"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>节点编号</th>
<th align="right">4</th>
<th align="right">8</th>
<th align="right">12</th>
<th align="right">19</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>三角形 1 的贡献</td>
<td align="right">2</td>
<td align="right">5</td>
<td align="right">7</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>三角形 2 的贡献</td>
<td align="right">3</td>
<td align="right">0</td>
<td align="right">11</td>
<td align="right">13</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>组装后的贡献</td>
<td align="right">5</td>
<td align="right">5</td>
<td align="right">18</td>
<td align="right">13</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>这些数字只用于说明组装。三角形 1 的第 3 个节点和三角形 2 的第 2 个节点都是节点 12，所以对应的 7 和 11 要相加。刚度矩阵组装时，行和列都按这个规则对应。</p>
<div class="note-table-scroll"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>写法</th>
<th>相加的范围</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Assemble</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∋</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname*{Assemble}_{e\ni k}[\cdots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mop"><span class="mord mathrm">Assemble</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mrel mtight">∋</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1774em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span></td>
<td>只取与节点 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span> 相连的三角形，将它们的贡献按光滑域 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span> 的节点顺序对齐后相加。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Assemble</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname*{Assemble}_{k}[\cdots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mop"><span class="mord mathrm">Assemble</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span></td>
<td>遍历所有光滑域，将它们的贡献按全局节点顺序对齐后相加。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Assemble</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname*{Assemble}_{e}[\cdots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mop"><span class="mord mathrm">Assemble</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.1514em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span></td>
<td>遍历所有母三角形，将它们的贡献按全局节点顺序对齐后相加。</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>图 1 说明的是“哪些四边形组成一个光滑域”；组装说明的是“这些单元或光滑域的矩阵怎样对应相加”。</p>
<h3 id="section-7">2.4 后文共用的记号</h3>
<p>下面几种记号会反复出现：</p>
<div class="note-table-scroll"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>记号</th>
<th>本文含义</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k,e,I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">e</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.07847em;">I</span></span></span></span></td>
<td>分别是光滑域中心节点编号、母三角形编号、参与插值的节点编号；<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j,l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.05724em;">j</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.01968em;">l</span></span></span></span> 也用于标记三角形的三个顶点。<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{ie}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3117em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是以顶点 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6595em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span> 为中心、位于三角形 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">e</span></span></span></span> 内的子域，与 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{ke}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3361em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是同一种记法。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g=1,2,3,4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">g</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">4</span></span></span></span></td>
<td>同一光滑域内的四个虚拟点编号；后文的 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mop op-symbol small-op" style="position:relative;top:0em;">∑</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.0017em;"><span style="top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">g</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.4358em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 均对这四点求和。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widetilde B_{kg},\widetilde N_{kg},\widetilde E_{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1.2294em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.9433em;"><span style="top:-3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.05017em;">B</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width:calc(100% - 0.1667em);margin-left:0.1667em;top:-3.6833em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3em;"></span><span style="height:0.26em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.26em" viewBox="0 0 600 260" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M200 55.538c-77 0-168 73.953-177 73.953-3 0-7
