<p>矩阵中的 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span> 表示相应尺寸的零块。<strong><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>31</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.07153em;">K</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">31</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍为零，<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>32</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.07153em;">K</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.3011em;"><span style="top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mtight">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一般不再为零。</strong> 固定 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">P</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol P,\boldsymbol T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8805em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.15972em;">P</span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord boldsymbol" style="margin-right:0.15972em;">T</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，位移不直接改变对流项；在完整方程组中，位移仍可通过孔压间接影响温度。</p>
<p>定义纯重力通量和对应对流部分</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">q</mi><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">g</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="2em"/><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mn>33</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">A</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>g</mi></munder><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="bold-italic">q</mi><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">g</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">r</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">v</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="true">~</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol q_f^{\mathrm{grav}}=\rho_fH_f\boldsymbol g,
